        <div style="font-size: 2.8rem; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1;">📿</div>
        <h3 class="devatva-heading" style="font-size: 1.3rem; color: #1c1917; margin-bottom: 8px;">Spiritual Bracelets</h3>
